{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06272","headline":"行路难 · 崔颢","name":"行路难","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见建章宫中金明枝，万万长条拂地垂。\n二月三月花如霰，九重幽深君不见。\n艳彩朝含四宝宫，香风旦入朝云殿。\n汉家宫女春未阑，爱此芳香朝暮看。\n看来看去心不忘，攀折将安镜台上。\n双双素手剪不成，两两红妆笑相向。\n建章昨夜起春风，一花飞落长信宫。\n长信丽人见花泣，忆此珍树何嗟及。\n我昔初在昭阳时，朝攀暮折登玉墀。\n只言岁岁长相对，不悟今朝遥相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}